=200&blur=200&s=922f909cbca1b5900a3762c28b869d27 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, sensei!! Your art is so beautiful!! May I request an illustration? The character is a dark and mysterious mage obsessed with forbidden knowledge. Evil, apathetic, and manipulative. A beautiful man. \n\nIf you want, you can include his spellbook (second reference image) as part of the illustration. Maybe he is casting magic from it? It's up to you!\n\nThese two illustrations of yours are my favorites: https://twitter.com/waffle820/status/1768844490469785721 https://twitter.com/waffle820/status/1785161171659784330\n\nI'm very excited!! Thank you again for considering my request!! (I'm very sorry if the machine translation is rude.)\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/5yaNyar", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@waffle820/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 959139, "client_id": 2376265, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e20a4d33/uploads/origins/95e97598-0202-409f-9e6a-3d2b17c2ff3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=455fc75680390b7a29a0b038d225e504", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e20a4d33/uploads/origins/95e97598-0202-409f-9e6a-3d2b17c2ff3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=455fc75680390b7a29a0b038d225e504, https://si.imgix.net/e20a4d33/uploads/origins/95e97598-0202-409f-9e6a-3d2b17c2ff3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e7a805dbca67529a8b1292e83cb964c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e20a4d33/uploads/origins/95e97598-0202-409f-9e6a-3d2b17c2ff3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d05e09dc62836db212502f300c080f79 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e20a4d33/uploads/origins/95e97598-0202-409f-9e6a-3d2b17c2ff3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ada8bea3fa1082bfb68d44efb0e21291", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e20a4d33/uploads/origins/95e97598-0202-409f-9e6a-3d2b17c2ff3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ada8bea3fa1082bfb68d44efb0e21291, https://si.imgix.net/e20a4d33/uploads/origins/95e97598-0202-409f-9e6a-3d2b17c2ff3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0e52cebed90e6f70ba655891ff200878 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e20a4d33/uploads/origins/95e97598-0202-409f-9e6a-3d2b17c2ff3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d81ebfa41bc67582f627f72fead36e33 3x"}, "body": "初めまして。配信アプリIRIAMにて活動しております、イヴ・アダムスと申します。\n以前よりXにてわふ様のイラストを拝見しており、神々しさの溢れるイラストに心惹かれご依頼させて頂きます。\n詳細を記入致しますので、ご確認のほどお願い致します。\n\n依頼物:一枚絵\n用途:配信サムネイル、リアルグッズ、広告イベント入賞時の提出用(商用利用を含みます)\nキャラ設定:アダムとイヴが食べた「知恵の実」を作った。アダムとイヴが楽園から追放されて暇を持て余し人間界に遊びにきている。\nテーマは「救済」で、縦横比や構図、衣装は全てお任せしたいです。(どこかにヘビがいると嬉しいです)(六芒星や鉤十字など宗教的すぎるとIRIAMの規約違反になってしまいますので、そこだけ把握お願いします)\n\n立ち絵のツイートを添付いたしますのでご確認頂けますと幸いです。(ツリーには顔の詳細があります)\nよろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://x.com/eveadams1119/status/1764787541314826381?s=46", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@waffle820/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/742f0daf/uploads/origins/023c3f1a-7080-4a02-9398-d8ed7585d979?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8172ec1aa0478a9c3ce439f4f581354b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/742f0daf/uploads/origins/023c3f1a-7080-4a02-9398-d8ed7585d979?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8172ec1aa0478a9c3ce439f4f581354b, http